{"id":"6f91db0be3167533","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_MProof.md","title":"MProof","display":"MProof","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"MProof","parameters":["e","g","z366","a"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"MProof"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>e</span><span>g</span><span>z366</span><span>a</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：正规模态。有序参数：<code>e</code>、<code>g</code>、<code>z366</code>、<code>a</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ MProof e g z366 a)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ MFlags e)\n  (and\n    (@ FormsM g)\n    (and\n      (@ FmM a)\n      (exists z353\n        (exists z367\n          (exists z368\n            (and\n              (@ Seq z366 z353)\n              (and\n                (@ Last z366 z367)\n                (and\n                  (@ Pair a z368 z367)\n                  (forall z349\n                    (implies (in z349 z353) (exists z350 (and (@ App z366 z349 z350) (@ MProofRow e g z366 z349 z350))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"852442b30ad8fc4e\" href=\"?note=852442b30ad8fc4e\" title=\"ZFC_FmM\">FmM</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e80843a1c1c14dbd\" href=\"?note=e80843a1c1c14dbd\" title=\"ZFC_FormsM\">FormsM</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\